      "id": "claim_d39ce544b77546d79d135410d8f52df5",
      "statement": "For local-wiki init/update runs the middleware pipeline is ordered translation (update only), then the OKF index middleware; chat runs with no middleware. There is no separate Claims middleware: Claims-source projection is an optional step inside the OKF middleware's afterAgent finalizeWikiArtifacts, fed by a deferred claimSources callback only in the repository path.",
