      "id": "claim_443ad0c0cb1846e5a42ba7761fa62259",
      "statement": "The OKF index middleware runs deterministic OKF conformance around the agent: beforeAgent (prepareWikiForAuthoring) migrates pages to valid front matter and snapshots their pre-authoring provenance, wrapToolCall decorates a successful write_file/edit_file result with a front-matter warning, and afterAgent (finalizeWikiArtifacts) synchronizes indexes, validates links, and stamps generated provenance.",
