      "statement": "The OKF middleware's wrapToolCall decorates only a successful write_file/edit_file result with a front-matter warning when the mutated wiki page has invalid YAML, deliberately not catching tool throws so recoverable tool errors are not made fatal; it restricts warnings to Markdown files inside the wiki subtree, skipping the reserved files index.md and log.md.",
