      "id": "claim_39d73e24346440ad8980401fa3429b54",
      "statement": "The wiki link validator resolves relative internal links against the whole backend tree (so links to repository files outside openwiki/ are not flagged) and reports missing files and missing heading anchors, but validates anchors only against .md targets and skips directory anchors and source-file line anchors like #L10; it excludes reserved files index.md, log.md, and INSTRUCTIONS.md and clears/re-applies broken-link stamps each pass (stamps inserted bottom-up by descending line number, files rewritten only when content changed) so they never accumulate.",
