      "statement": "The translation middleware runs only on update runs in the local-wiki shared-core path and closes the gap that an incremental update leaves when the wiki language changes, since the agent only rewrites pages whose source changed. Repository init/update bypass this middleware entirely and handle language switches through requiredRewritePages page jobs.",
