      "id": "claim_2675928562db4a7ea807ae5db1524b08",
      "statement": "resolveTranslationPlan returns undefined for any command other than update; it targets the requested language else the persisted one else English, and only sets translateAll when a requested language's primary subtag differs from the persisted one (so a region-only change like en to en-GB does not force a full retranslation). Malformed tags Intl.Locale cannot parse fall back to comparing the raw tag so plan resolution never crashes.",
