      "id": "claim_9e7c82a046864479a8b4c2733acf78ba",
      "statement": "The translation pass does one of three things cheapest-first: with nothing to do it only walks the tree (zero model calls), on a plain update it retranslates only pages marked openwiki_translation_pending, and on a real language switch it retranslates every page; onStatus announces the pass lazily just before the first page actually translated, so a no-op sweep stays silent.",
